{"title":"Aug 6 — Busan Full Day","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Aug 6 — Busan Full Day"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Thursday · August 6, 2026 · Day 12 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Busan Full Day 🦐</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Gamcheon · BIFF Square · Jagalchi Market · Songdo Cable Car · Oryukdo Skywalk · Busan</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug06\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug06').setView([35.0975, 129.0400], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], iconAnchor:[11,11], popupAnchor:[0,-13] });\n  }\n  var pts = [\n    { name:'🏨 L7 Haeundae by Lotte Hotels', lat:35.1620, lng:129.1601, hotel:true, url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan' },\n    { name:'Gamcheon Culture Village 🎨', lat:35.0975, lng:129.0147, c:'#E53935', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gamcheon+Culture+Village+Busan' },\n    { name:'BIFF Square 🎬', lat:35.1010, lng:129.0280, c:'#1565C0', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=BIFF+Square+Busan' },\n    { name:'Jagalchi Market 🦀', lat:35.0968, lng:129.0301, c:'#43A047', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jagalchi+Market+Busan' },\n    { name:'Songdo Cable Car 🚡', lat:35.0853, lng:129.0131, c:'#AB47BC', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Songdo+Beach+Cable+Car+Busan' },\n    { name:'Oryukdo Skywalk 🌁', lat:35.0817, lng:129.1208, c:'#FFA726', url:'https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oryukdo+Skywalk+Busan' },\n  ];\n  window.pageMap = map; window.pageMarkers = [];\n  pts.forEach(function(p) {\n    var m = L.marker([p.lat, p.lng], { icon: p.hotel ? hotelDot() : dot(p.c) }).addTo(map);\n    var html = '<b>' + p.name + '</b>';\n    if (p.url) html += '<br><a href=\"' + p.url + '\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Open in Maps →</a>';\n    m.bindPopup(html);\n    window.pageMarkers.push({ marker: m, lat: p.lat, lng: p.lng });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Breakfast — L7 Haeundae</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T07:00\" data-lat=\"35.1620\" data-lng=\"129.1601\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">07:00–10:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag booked\">INCLUDED ✓</span><span class=\"tag meal\">🍳 Breakfast Buffet</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Floating Restaurant — Breakfast Buffet</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Buffet with fresh seasonal ingredients and Busan local delicacies. <strong>2F · 07:00–10:00</strong>. Breakfast included in your booking — no extra charge.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Go early — last seating closes at 10:00 sharp</li>\n        <li>Adult ₩30,000 / Child ₩22,000 (included)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=L7+Haeundae+by+Lotte+Hotels+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 L7 Haeundae</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/L7해운대바이롯데호텔\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Morning — Gamcheon Village</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card morning\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T09:30\" data-lat=\"35.0975\" data-lng=\"129.0147\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">09:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🎨 Village</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Gamcheon Culture Village</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Busan's \"Santorini\" — a hillside village of pastel-painted houses, winding alleys, murals, and art installations. Originally a poor neighbourhood, now a must-visit creative district. Best in morning before afternoon crowds.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Pick up a map at the village info centre (stamp rally available)</li>\n        <li>Look for the Little Prince statue — iconic photo spot</li>\n        <li>Wear comfortable shoes — it's hilly</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gamcheon+Culture+Village+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Gamcheon</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/감천문화마을\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Lunch</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T12:00\" data-lat=\"35.1010\" data-lng=\"129.0280\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">12:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🎬 Lunch</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">BIFF Square — Street Food</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Busan International Film Festival's home street is lined with film star handprints and great street food stalls. Try:\n      <ul>\n        <li>씨앗 호떡 (Ssiat Hotteok) — Busan's signature seed-filled hotteok, crispy and caramelised</li>\n        <li>Soondae (blood sausage) with tteok</li>\n        <li>Eomuk (fish cake) skewers with broth</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=BIFF+Square+Nampo+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 BIFF Square</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/BIFF광장+부산\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Afternoon — Jagalchi & Songdo</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T14:00\" data-lat=\"35.0968\" data-lng=\"129.0301\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">14:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🦀 Market</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Jagalchi Fish Market</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Korea's largest seafood market — a Busan institution. Rows of live sea creatures: abalone, sea cucumber, flounder, crab, and more. The market women (자갈치아지매) are legendary. You can buy fish upstairs and have it prepared for you to eat on-site.\n      <ul>\n        <li>Go to the upper floors for sit-down fresh fish meals</li>\n        <li>Haggling is expected</li>\n        <li>Morning is busiest but afternoon still lively</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jagalchi+Market+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Jagalchi</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/자갈치시장\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card afternoon\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T16:00\" data-lat=\"35.0853\" data-lng=\"129.0131\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">16:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🚡 Cable Car</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Songdo Beach Cable Car</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Glass-bottomed gondolas above a dramatic rocky coastline — connects Songdo Beach to Amnam Park. 1.6km over the sea, ~10 min each way. Stunning views over the Busan coastline and islands.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Songdo+Beach+Cable+Car+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Songdo Cable Car</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/송도해상케이블카\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Sunset</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card evening\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T18:00\" data-lat=\"35.0817\" data-lng=\"129.1208\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">18:00</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag activity\">🌁 Viewpoint</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Oryukdo Skywalk</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Glass-floored skywalk protruding over the rocky cliffs with Oryukdo (Five-Six Islands) in view — Korea's southernmost point before the open sea. Spectacular sunset spot. Free entry. Glass shoe covers provided.</div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oryukdo+Skywalk+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Oryukdo Skywalk</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/오륙도스카이워크\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"section-header\">Dinner</div>\n\n<div class=\"event-card meal\" data-dt=\"2026-08-06T19:30\" data-lat=\"35.1590\" data-lng=\"129.1630\">\n  <div class=\"event-time\">19:30</div>\n  <div class=\"event-body\">\n    <div class=\"event-tags\"><span class=\"tag meal\">🦐 Feast</span></div>\n    <div class=\"event-name\">Seafood Feast — Last Busan Dinner</div>\n    <div class=\"event-notes\">Final Busan night — go big! Options:\n      <ul>\n        <li>Haeundae 회센터 (raw fish centre) — multiple restaurants, pick your fish live</li>\n        <li>Grilled lobster or snow crab</li>\n        <li>Haemul pajeon + makgeolli (seafood pancake with rice wine)</li>\n        <li>Ganjang gejang (if you missed it in Seoul)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"event-links\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=seafood+feast+restaurant+Busan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link\">📍 Find Seafood</a>\n      <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/p/search/부산+해산물+맛집\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"maps-link naver-link\">🗺 Naver</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"note-box\"><strong>KTX tomorrow</strong> — buy tickets early. Target 10:00–11:00 AM departure from Busan station. Journey to Seoul ~2.5 hrs. Book at Korail website or at the station.</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"day-hero\">\n  <div class=\"day-badge\">Thursday · August 6, 2026 · Day 12 of 15</div>\n  <h1 class=\"day-title\">Busan Full Day 🦐</h1>\n  <div class=\"day-subtitle\">📍 Gamcheon · BIFF Square · Jagalchi Market · Songdo Cable Car · Oryukdo Skywalk · Busan</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"map-aug06\" class=\"day-map\"></div>\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var map = L.map('map-aug06').setView([35.0975, 129.0400], 12);\n  L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n    attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OSM</a>'\n  }).addTo(map);\n  function dot(c) {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:'+c+';border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.4)\"></div>', iconSize:[13,13], iconAnchor:[6,6], popupAnchor:[0,-8] });\n  }\n  function hotelDot() {\n    return L.divIcon({ className:'', html:'<div style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A148C;border:2.5px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1;color:#fff\">★</div>', iconSize:[22,22], 